+# Plain HTTP for internal hosts
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "HTTPS everywhere, no plaintext exception": plain HTTP is not permitted for internal hosts, and internal traffic is held to the same HTTPS requirement as any other. The stated reason is that proper certificate management is now in place.
